          "request": {
            "name": "Grafana Update User Email",
            "description": {
              "content": "This API operation allows for updating the email address associated with a user account in Grafana. When invoked via a GET request to the /user/email/update endpoint, it modifies the email address of the currently authenticated user. The operation requires the user to be logged in and typically needs the new email address to be provided as a parameter. This endpoint is useful for maintaining accurate user contact information and ensuring proper communication channels within the Grafana platform.",
